# Where the API lives.
#
# Leave this unset for both local development and the Vercel deployment: calls
# go to /api/v1 on the same origin, handled by the Vite proxy locally and by the
# Vercel rewrite in production. Same-origin keeps the refresh-token cookie simple.
#
# Set it only if the browser should call the backend directly on another host.
# That also needs ALLOWED_ORIGINS and COOKIE_SAMESITE=none on the backend.
# VITE_API_URL=https://sva-api.onrender.com/api/v1
